{"v":4,"catch":"每次玩，神秘感都會加深！！","desc":"《XEVIOUS》是NAMCO於1982年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n控制你自己的 Solvalou 並與 XEVIOUS 軍隊作戰。\n使用 Zapper 摧毀空中的敵人，使用 Blaster 摧毀地面上的敵人。\n此外，本作中出現了26種角色，每一種都有代號。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-09-24","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9409b3898e37ef449c65fc7463772a6bfd05622d9d89e11323b356b473444c5f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/648eb418c41ebebb67030f619c069ad1aed8c3738def3f45be5dec74b14d605d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d216b062e2011321dff5463fa952665584f84570ae7bc37c57bf179bd5bf9ea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/431bfa2ec280f61a44bffb43c1b8feaffac2919ddd4297630cca51659b7df422.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ff50feb302994965fd61ee42758e5a11b53b02d48e378b1569c788364e5c40e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b5951a6e1febc82644bee8189d29dcfb040e9259e84b35aa3211557b8360cd6b.jpg"],"titleId":"010082c015abc000","dlc":[]}